  "causebase_summary": "According to its website, AUSTRALIAN LGBTQ BOARD AND EXECUTIVE INCLUSION FORUM LIMITED (ALBEI) describes its mission as promoting diversity and inclusion in company boardrooms by fostering discussions among company board members, nominations committees, executive search firms, industry governance bodies and individuals. The site invites people to subscribe for information about ALBEI events, refers to a set of “projects” described as priority areas, and asks visitors to “join the discussion” by sending questions or offers to help. The material presented is organisation-authored and frames ALBEI’s work in terms of convening conversations, staging events and maintaining projects focused on boardroom inclusion. The ACNC register entry is listed in the evidence pack but no financial statements or program reporting were supplied in the selected excerpts. The organisation’s structured geography in the evidence is New South Wales (NSW).",
